{
  "title": "TSH\u2013free-thyroxine coupling does not establish incremental non-HDL cholesterol prediction across NHANES cycles",
  "abstract": "Adding a logTSH \u00d7 logFT4 interaction to flexible individual thyroid-hormone and conventional predictors did not establish improved non-HDL cholesterol prediction in exploratory NHANES2007\u20132008 to2009\u20132010 transfer (4,620 source and 1,709 target adults): weighted MSE difference 0.911732 (mg/dL)\u00b2 (0.059% worse), jointPSU-bootstrap95% interval [-11.654964,12.075954].",
